    accTitle: Where package-parse-tree fits
    accDescr: A module such as module-ecommerce-ai sends a query to parse-tree through PTClient. Parse-tree asks the Named Entity Linker which known things are in the text, resolves them against its ontology store in SQLite, and returns a category, instance and attribute tree.
    MOD["module-ecommerce-ai<br>(or any caller)"] -- "PTClient" --> PT["package-parse-tree<br>:8093"]:::here
    ST["package-search-trainer"] -. "pins as a dependency" .-> PT
    PT -- "HTTP, NEL_SERVER" --> NEL["package-named-entity-linker<br>:8092"]
    PT --> KG[("Ontology and KG store<br>SQLite via base-tdb-models")]
    PT --> OUT["Category, Instance,<br>Attribute, Value tree"]
